  first | exact @GlobalTheory.SatBcZero.satU_eq_of_ubc_eq | exact GlobalTheory.SatBcZero.satU_eq_of_ubc_eq | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.SatBcZero.satU_eq_of_ubc_eq <;> assumption)
